## 📰 News Finder

News Finder is a simple web application built with Python and Streamlit that allows users to search for news on any topic without requiring an API key.

## 🚀 Features

- Search news by any topic
- Simple and user-friendly interface
- Displays latest available news results
- No API key required
- Fast and easy to use

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Requests
- XML ElementTree
- Google News RSS

